# One line away from aa-counter-guard: no turrets, ever. The question the
# working siting finally made askable -- "defence on" historically meant
# "defence attempted and silently refused", and the first batch where
# turrets actually LANDED spent 25-45k a match on them and won 6/24 at a
# rung the attempted-defence bot won 10/12. This arm asks whether landing
# them was worth landing ([[policy-holding-ground]]).

name aa-counter-guard-nocover
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank
heavies none
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
expand 1
counter 1
cover 0
intercept 1
guard_cap 0
aa_cover 0
forward 0
scout 0
raid 0
rush 0
creep 0
riposte 0
tech 0
